!! Config Defaults

```
\procedure ~config(name:"Defaults" params:"l-prime/true feedback/5 tool-render/elements") ~ <<has config name=<<name>> Params=<<params>>>>
```

<<~ config Defaults>>

`l-prime/true` ~ spring-loaded essence ward, Wand-lit at boot inside `Drift-Ward`, Arcana (`0` operator only) lifts one turn, Sword re-arms each close · `feedback/5` ~ 5-8 every marker inline · `tool-render/elements` ~ 🜂 🜄 🜁 🜃 🜍.

''Web3-only law:'' The Lares stack operates web3 local-first + causal-islands. Any web2 bridge sits behind a causal-island boundary. No web2 ontology, models, code, or flows enter the Lares stack proper.

